{"id": "3013486", "revid": "82644", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3013486", "title": "Auxologie", "text": "Auxologia (din , \"aux\u014d\", sau \"\u03b1\u1f50\u03be\u03ac\u03bd\u03c9\", \"auxan\u014d\", adic\u0103 \u201ea cre\u0219te\u201d \u0219i \"\u03bb\u03cc\u03b3\u03bf\u03c2\", \"logos\", \u201e\u0219tiin\u021b\u0103\u201d) este un metatermen care acoper\u0103 studiul tuturor aspectelor cre\u0219terii fizice umane (de\u0219i este, de asemenea, fundamental pentru biologie). Auxologia este o \u0219tiin\u021b\u0103 multidisciplinar\u0103 care implic\u0103 \u0219tiin\u021bele s\u0103n\u0103t\u0103\u021bii/medicina (pediatrie, medicin\u0103 general\u0103, endocrinologie, neuroendocrinologie, fiziologie, epidemiologie) \u0219i, \u00eentr-o m\u0103sur\u0103 mai mic\u0103: \u0219tiin\u021ba nutri\u021biei, genetic\u0103, antropologie, antropometrie, ergonomie, istorie, istorie economic\u0103, economie, socio-economie, sociologie, s\u0103n\u0103tate public\u0103 \u0219i psihologie, printre altele."}
